   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2023-04-26",
   "text": "Supreme Court Code of Conduct Act\n This bill requires the Supreme Court to issue a code of conduct for the Chief Justice and Justices. The Supreme Court must publish the code of conduct on its website and designate an individual to process complaints of misconduct by the Chief Justice and Justices."
  }
